    <briefdescription>
<para>Context-free <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_capture_analysis" kindref="compound">CaptureAnalysis</ref> provider, which computes and caches whether an object is captured in the function at all, but does not distinguish whether it was captured before or after the context instruction. </para>
